    "description": "<p>You create kinetic wards to force projectiles off target.</p><p>Choose a creature within <strong>10 spaces.</strong> Until the start of your next turn, that creature increases its <strong>Defense</strong> by <strong>+2</strong> against <strong>Ranged</strong> attacks only.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you can increase the number of targets by <strong>+1</strong> per extra success.</p><p>You can also or increase the bonus to <strong>Defense</strong> vs. <strong>Ranged</strong> attacks by <strong>+2</strong> per extra success.</p><p>You may spend <strong>1 Resolve</strong> to cast this spell on another creature's turn.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.qAM0rFhxdRNkcYuv]{Arrow Ward}</p>",
